{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28043","headline":"缑山月夜闻王子晋吹笙 · 厉玄","name":"缑山月夜闻王子晋吹笙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缑山明月夜，岑寂隔尘氛。\n紫府参差曲，清宵次第闻。\n韵流多入洞，声度半和云。\n拂竹鸾惊侣，经松鹤对羣。\n蟾光听处合，仙路望中分。\n坐惜千岩曙，遗香过汝坟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"厉玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}